  "description": "Reusable gently stepped copper-inlaid pale-stone path with amethyst-topped lanterns and optional east junction. LanternWalk(levels,east_exit) uses a list of local walking Ys (>=3, adjacent difference <=1), size 7 x (max(levels)+9) x len(levels); stairs face each rise and piers support terrain gaps. ObservatoryApproach(length) is a 5-wide level branch, size length x19x5, local walkingY10. Explicit clearance above the walkway. Demo north-south terrain profile ground_level8; build(branch=True) demonstrates level branch at ground_level10.",
